lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101999","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101999","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101999.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101999.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-12T18:20:18Z"},"body":"Implements or expands on current implementation of the [`XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_android_surface`](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/html/xrspec.html#XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_android_surface), [`XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_opengl_es`](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/html/xrspec.html#XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_opengl_es), and [`XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_vulkan`](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/html/xrspec.html#XR_FB_swapchain_update_state_vulkan) OpenXR extensions.\r\n\r\nThe OpenGL ES and Vulkan extensions allow for updating many parameters on how the textures are sampled in composition layers. These options are presented as renderer-agnostic but have some slight differences (i.e. OpenGL doesn't support the mirror clamp to edge wrap mode, and Vulkan can't disable mipmapping I believe).\r\n\r\nThe android extension allows for the updating of the resolution of android surfaces.\r\n\r\nDiscussion was had at the last XR meeting on whether these implementations should live in core or the vendor extension, and the consensus was that it should live in core. Here is the comment about it from the XR meeting agenda:\r\n> **Discussion in XR meeting**: Conclusion that we see this as an exception to our rules, trying to implement the needed functionality in the vendor plugin would be far more problematic in the future when this becomes more widely adopted into a KHR or EXT extension. It makes more sense that any properties we add just get deprecated if there are differences in runtime functionality in the future.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101999/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101999/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}